<BaseLayout title="Terms of Use — EduBooks Free PDF Library" description="Terms for accessing, reading, downloading and using free EduBooks educational books and PDF workbooks." keywords="EduBooks terms, free educational books, PDF use, copyright, educational resources">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="section-label" data-en="INFORMATION" data-fr="INFORMATIONS" data-es="INFORMACIÓN">INFORMATION</span><h1 data-en="Website terms" data-fr="Conditions du site" data-es="Términos del sitio">Website terms</h1><p data-en="Terms governing access to the EduBooks website and its free learning resources." data-fr="Conditions régissant l’accès au site EduBooks et à ses ressources pédagogiques gratuites." data-es="Condiciones que regulan el acceso al sitio EduBooks y a sus recursos educativos gratuitos.">Terms governing access to the EduBooks website and its free learning resources.</p></div></section>
<section class="content-section"><div class="container content-narrow">
<h2 data-en="Free educational access" data-fr="Accès éducatif gratuit" data-es="Acceso educativo gratuito">Free educational access</h2>
<p data-en="EduBooks is a free, website-only educational library. There is no checkout, subscription, paid download or external store. A book appears in the public catalogue only after its publication requirements have been met and its approved files are available." data-fr="EduBooks est une bibliothèque éducative gratuite, accessible uniquement sur ce site. Il n’y a ni paiement, ni abonnement, ni téléchargement payant, ni boutique externe. Un livre n’apparaît dans le catalogue public qu’après satisfaction des exigences de publication et mise à disposition de ses fichiers approuvés." data-es="EduBooks es una biblioteca educativa gratuita disponible únicamente en este sitio. No hay pagos, suscripciones, descargas de pago ni tiendas externas. Un libro solo aparece en el catálogo público cuando cumple los requisitos de publicación y sus archivos aprobados están disponibles.">EduBooks is a free, website-only educational library. There is no checkout, subscription, paid download or external store. A book appears in the public catalogue only after its publication requirements have been met and its approved files are available.</p>
<h2 data-en="Permitted use" data-fr="Utilisation autorisée" data-es="Uso permitido">Permitted use</h2>
<p data-en="You may access the website and use available resources for lawful personal learning and educational reference. Unless a specific resource states otherwise, you must not republish, sell, redistribute, adapt or present EduBooks materials as your own without prior permission from the relevant rights holder." data-fr="Vous pouvez consulter le site et utiliser les ressources disponibles pour votre apprentissage personnel licite et comme référence éducative. Sauf indication contraire d’une ressource, vous ne devez pas republier, vendre, redistribuer, adapter ou présenter les contenus EduBooks comme les vôtres sans autorisation préalable du titulaire des droits concerné." data-es="Puedes acceder al sitio y utilizar los recursos disponibles para el aprendizaje personal lícito y como referencia educativa. Salvo que un recurso indique lo contrario, no debes volver a publicar, vender, redistribuir, adaptar ni presentar los materiales de EduBooks como propios sin autorización previa del titular de los derechos correspondiente.">You may access the website and use available resources for lawful personal learning and educational reference. Unless a specific resource states otherwise, you must not republish, sell, redistribute, adapt or present EduBooks materials as your own without prior permission from the relevant rights holder.</p>
<h2 data-en="Intellectual property and attribution" data-fr="Propriété intellectuelle et attribution" data-es="Propiedad intelectual y atribución">Intellectual property and attribution</h2>
<p data-en="Rights in text, illustrations, fonts and other materials remain with their respective owners. Third-party material must be used only under its applicable licence or permission. A free download does not transfer copyright or grant a general redistribution licence." data-fr="Les droits sur les textes, illustrations, polices et autres éléments restent la propriété de leurs titulaires respectifs. Les contenus de tiers ne peuvent être utilisés que conformément à leur licence ou autorisation applicable. Un téléchargement gratuit ne transfère pas les droits d’auteur et n’accorde pas de licence générale de redistribution." data-es="Los derechos sobre textos, ilustraciones, fuentes y otros materiales pertenecen a sus respectivos titulares. El material de terceros solo puede utilizarse conforme a su licencia o autorización aplicable. Una descarga gratuita no transfiere los derechos de autor ni concede una licencia general de redistribución.">Rights in text, illustrations, fonts and other materials remain with their respective owners. Third-party material must be used only under its applicable licence or permission. A free download does not transfer copyright or grant a general redistribution licence.</p>
<h2 data-en="Availability and accuracy" data-fr="Disponibilité et exactitude" data-es="Disponibilidad y exactitud">Availability and accuracy</h2>
<p data-en="The website and files may be updated, corrected, moved or temporarily unavailable. Educational content is provided for learning support and is not a substitute for professional, legal, medical or other specialist advice." data-fr="Le site et les fichiers peuvent être mis à jour, corrigés, déplacés ou temporairement indisponibles. Les contenus pédagogiques sont fournis à titre d’accompagnement et ne remplacent pas un conseil professionnel, juridique, médical ou spécialisé." data-es="El sitio y los archivos pueden actualizarse, corregirse, trasladarse o dejar de estar disponibles temporalmente. El contenido educativo se ofrece como apoyo al aprendizaje y no sustituye el asesoramiento profesional, jurídico, médico o especializado.">The website and files may be updated, corrected, moved or temporarily unavailable. Educational content is provided for learning support and is not a substitute for professional, legal, medical or other specialist advice.</p>
<h2 data-en="External services and contact" data-fr="Services externes et contact" data-es="Servicios externos y contacto">External services and contact</h2>
<p data-en="External links are provided for convenience and are governed by the destination service's terms. For questions about the project or its materials, use the social links in the website footer." data-fr="Les liens externes sont fournis à titre pratique et sont soumis aux conditions du service de destination. Pour toute question concernant le projet ou ses ressources, utilisez les liens sociaux du pied de page." data-es="Los enlaces externos se facilitan por comodidad y se rigen por las condiciones del servicio de destino. Para consultas sobre el proyecto o sus materiales, utiliza los enlaces sociales del pie de página.">External links are provided for convenience and are governed by the destination service's terms. For questions about the project or its materials, use the social links in the website footer.</p>
